('mcp-supabase', 'mcp', 'Supabase MCP Server', 'Official Supabase MCP server — query databases, manage tables, and run SQL migrations from any MCP-compatible agent.', 'The official Supabase Model Context Protocol server gives agents full access to Supabase projects: query tables with natural language → SQL, manage schema, inspect RLS policies, execute migrations, and access Storage. Compatible with Claude Desktop, Hermes, Cursor, and any MCP host.', 'database', ARRAY['Claude','Open WebUI'], true, true, 'https://github.com/supabase-community/supabase-mcp', 'Supabase', ARRAY['supabase','database','sql','mcp','official']),

